<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Marathi strings of the iPhone UI. values/strings.xml has the comments for each key: where the text shows,
  the placeholders and the length limits. docs/LOCALIZATION_GLOSSARY.md gives the terms and their sources.
  The polite form "तुम्ही" with "-आ", as Marathi iOS writes "जतन करा" and "हटवा". "झटका" is the episode, as Marathi says
  "मायग्रेनचा झटका". Marathi has the CLDR plural forms one and other.
  The duration chips have no unit, because "12–24 तास" is longer than 7 characters: the captions name the hours.
-->
